1
00:00:00,382 --> 00:00:02,302
(Leonard:)So, what's going on?

2
00:00:02,468 --> 00:00:03,758
(Raj:)Okay, here's the deal.

3
00:00:03,928 --> 00:00:07,098
(Raj:)Six months ago, my research
testing the predicted composition...

4
00:00:07,264 --> 00:00:09,764
(Raj:)...of trans-Neptunian objects
ran into a dead end.

5
00:00:09,934 --> 00:00:11,104
(Howard:)So?

6
00:00:11,268 --> 00:00:14,268
My visa is only good as long
as I'm employed at the university.

7
00:00:14,438 --> 00:00:17,438
(Raj:)When they find out I've got squat,
they're gonna cut me off.

8
00:00:17,608 --> 00:00:20,778
By the way, when I say "squat,"
I mean "diddlysquat."

9
00:00:21,403 --> 00:00:23,943
(Raj:)I wish I had squat.

10
00:00:24,823 --> 00:00:27,613
(Leonard:)Wait. What have you been doing
for the past six months?

11
00:00:27,785 --> 00:00:29,955
(Raj:)You know, checking e-mail...

12
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,120
(Raj:)...updating my Facebook status...

13
00:00:32,289 --> 00:00:34,789
(Raj:)...messing up Wikipedia entries.

14
00:00:36,794 --> 00:00:40,294
(Raj:)Did you know Netflix lets you
stream movies on your computer now?

15
00:00:40,714 --> 00:00:44,174
(Sheldon:)You've continued to take the university's
money under false pretenses?

16
00:00:44,343 --> 00:00:46,803
(Sheldon:)Highly unethical for an astrophysicist.

17
00:00:46,971 --> 00:00:49,811
(Sheldon:)Although, practically mandatory
for a pirate.

18
00:00:51,642 --> 00:00:54,312
I don't wanna go back to India.
It's hot and loud.

19
00:00:54,478 --> 00:00:58,018
(Raj:)And there's so many people.

